  "body": "As seen in various threads, using VideoFrame requires explicit closing, for instance when aborting streams.\r\nTee might be an issue, requiring to use structured cloning and a realtime mode to ensure limited buffering and branch independence.\r\nIf we start adding features for VideoFrame, we can wonder whether dedicated stream constructs for VideoFrame, like BYOB for array buffers, could be more ergonomic.",
